 r←Test_Log_101(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;msg;rc;L;lines;list
⍝ The turn of the year was dealt with earlier: the log file holds only data of the current year,
⍝ while the folder still holds a monthly file of an earlier year.
⍝ The monthly file of the current year must be written nevertheless: the month of a file of an
⍝ earlier year says nothing about what was saved for this year.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 tempDir←∆GetTempDir'-Log/'
 rc←'Create!'F.CheckPath tempDir
 Assert rc
 L←##.Server.Logs
 lines←⊃F.NGET(∆TEMP_TEST_DATA,'/LogFile/app-log.txt')1
 lines←('2024-'∘≡¨5↑¨lines)/lines                   ⍝ Only the data of the current year
 (⊂lines)F.NPUT(tempDir,L.GetLogFilename)1
 (⊂'Group,Name,Version,Year,Month,Downloads')F.NPUT(tempDir,'usage-data-2023-11.csv')1
 L.ProcessLogFile tempDir(2024 3 4)

 list←{⊃,/1↓⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨F.ListFiles tempDir,'usage-data-2024-*.csv'
 →T.GoToTidyUp~list ∆LazyMatch,⊂'usage-data-2024-02.csv'

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←F.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
